.TH ZDOTS-SNAPSHOT 1 "2026-07-21" "zdots" "zdots manual"
.SH NAME
zdots-snapshot \- zdots\-snapshot list
.SH SYNOPSIS
See OPTIONS below (generated from \fBzdots-snapshot --help\fR).
.SH OPTIONS
.nf
Usage: zdots-snapshot <name> -- <command...>
       zdots-snapshot list
       zdots-snapshot show <name>

Capture a command's stdout under <name> and diff it against the previous
capture — an evolution timeline for any re-runnable report.

Exit status: the captured command's (capture is kept either way).
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
agent-guide(1), zdots-doctor(1)
